            <lg xml:id="m-b24c3ecf-5ea1-45f8-ae6e-074a0f30432c">
              <l xml:id="m-688b02db-3ce2-4f76-86f2-14280d160897" facs="#m-86e34c47-da82-49f9-b7ec-97856a601925" label="ambiguous">1340</l><l xml:id="m-bf184a41-55c2-4352-b4b4-a06ff763ae2b" facs="#m-19df8575-51df-4761-af74-28a0321def3a" label="ambiguous">Ianuary 21.</l><l xml:id="m-e4da9709-9066-4491-b14a-50cac2c133f0" facs="#m-fe5095fa-fd33-4026-82d0-021fd3f6be82" label="text-like">Anter Septuagesima, the Alleluia. and its Verse are omitted, and the Tract</l><l xml:id="m-80154dc3-60e4-4059-9405-99d8cbaaa1f5" facs="#m-b5f25db0-8ce9-4598-8a35-1f0e2d12d71b" label="lyrics-like">Véni spónsa Christi, 1217, is said instead.</l><l xml:id="m-71de2c90-417c-4336-b03d-8908a1fca26a" facs="#m-aba19847-6f5a-4894-bc81-9bc51d6083db" label="lyrics-like">Gospel. Símile erit regnum caelórum decem. p. 1219.</l><l xml:id="m-40f37eee-afca-4cb6-a046-317d38caa1a6" facs="#m-1cb3431d-7128-41b0-aec4-21c185b5926f" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Afferéntur. D. 1219</l><l xml:id="m-9416e6db-e3b5-4f8f-ab48-02aec6e1a85b" facs="#m-d4ccef09-0679-44bd-b2e2-dfe4ed3016e3" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-e5afe6c4-c33b-422d-9efc-e08fdf1211ac" facs="#m-7edac79c-c4be-4db6-8b70-018ea35eed6b" label="lyrics-like">Ostias, Dómine, quas tibi offé- et Mártyre tua, vincula peccató¬</l><l xml:id="m-13c266d6-313d-40d1-94e6-ca4f4468612b" facs="#m-e5dfcd94-ac69-4699-aba8-2546008ccf4f" label="lyrics-like">It rimus, propitius súscipe: et rum nostrórum absólve. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-8df335d7-c755-4ed3-b33e-d1cc02cf3cea" facs="#m-cb5d3cff-cd8e-412a-876c-8b6a85d53804" label="lyrics-like">intercedénte beáta Agnéte Virgine ! minum.</l><l xml:id="m-01321cde-baeb-430a-bc42-56ec8c90c848" facs="#m-bf371d4c-dedb-4868-a530-e90354fa5541" label="lyrics-like">Communion. Quinque prudéntes. p. 1228.</l><l xml:id="m-615cfd96-cbe6-47a0-8deb-03e4d9becacd" facs="#m-c91bc02c-f2e4-4900-8857-759604b675cb" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-09b8fab6-910c-4e7b-8004-9f6093349c43" facs="#m-6de6031d-a6f9-4627-a7a6-bb0a95fad759" label="lyrics-like">Efécti cibo potúque caelésti,l moratióne percépimus, ejus muniá¬</l><l xml:id="m-ccf7ac7a-f071-410b-aea6-9c549a770758" facs="#m-42e26f62-8731-4e08-b1a1-6f0fada0bcaf" label="lyrics-like">RDeus noster, te súpplices exo¬ mur et précibus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-ce74d994-5a73-45ff-9c4e-39f0f3688d4b" facs="#m-239b1586-8a17-4a03-9462-eac89e23e42b" label="lyrics-like">rámus: ut, in cujus haec comme¬</l><l xml:id="m-a908ce95-3eed-4f63-a7b5-406c445f5a0a" facs="#m-44dfbd24-9a28-49a0-b062-9fb5bd04e0a4" label="text-like">At Second Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-01f9f2e4-d4d9-4320-8c82-fe271b430cd0" facs="#m-4c482524-652a-4f3e-8432-6dcef6c98aed" label="lyrics-like">Psalms. I. Dixit Dóminus. 7. c. p. 132. — 2. Confitébor tibi. 7. c.</l><l xml:id="m-3a991dda-1d94-49f0-b944-2fc3f79991dc" facs="#m-18e11731-7c88-444a-9584-2e65c283fc2e" label="lyrics-like">p. 139. — 3. Beátus vir. 7. c. p. 146. — 4. Laudáte púeri. 8. G. p. 152.</l><l xml:id="m-debfb320-de24-451d-b05c-554453c9f2a9" facs="#m-5d962791-6f8f-40e1-b891-8af43c27fd95" label="lyrics-like">— 5. Láuda Jerúsalem. 8. G. p. 206.</l><l xml:id="m-c2f900e3-c95e-4268-aa19-0e0001f06d80" facs="#m-9e6ad069-5486-49dd-bb81-635d779cc3cf" label="ambiguous">1.Ant.¿</l><l xml:id="m-ebac322b-e1da-4f18-9db0-1c9cb89128bb" facs="#m-8e7a656e-ec3c-4031-89d2-d3e56d58ce41" label="ambiguous">7.e</l><l xml:id="m-fe247288-0f50-4f3e-874a-82374a21ff35" facs="#m-109d8490-9c76-48a8-8bb6-6e7f538b2424" label="lyrics-like">Ngréssa Agnes“ turpi-túdinis lócum, Ange-lum</l><l xml:id="m-edcc103c-3b1b-4986-917a-085d9a33ee8d" facs="#m-eb7dce6a-2988-4edc-8253-7bebe5c5d33b" label="ambiguous">7.e</l><l xml:id="m-51734290-ed18-48c7-bd46-c8156badf01e" facs="#m-4e9f78cf-dffc-430b-b8f9-cba09186ac12" label="lyrics-like">Dómini praeparátum invé-nit. E u o u a e. I Ecum</l><l xml:id="m-bd52a4ba-f3d3-4d63-9b8b-669a1435ac40" facs="#m-e6f0e4a1-05c6-4d8b-b245-53b717a42b62" label="lyrics-like">enim hábe-o“ custódem córpo-ris mé-i, Ange-lum Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-cedaffc6-6a3d-4095-b0b1-5f15fb3efec4" facs="#m-b453ee23-0888-4b6a-bf74-e1c222295321" label="ambiguous">3.Ant.H</l><l xml:id="m-ae403e44-f3fc-4983-b9cb-9da775cc66e9" facs="#m-c2705d09-cd00-4da0-9d23-4af3ac33b5e1" label="ambiguous">7.e</l><l xml:id="m-3f48e99c-081a-43e9-b848-ea93ae3d8daf" facs="#m-6523ba87-9fd7-4bb8-b776-00cb71b62104" label="ambiguous">mi-ni. Eu o u a e. H</l><l xml:id="m-08a283ff-0e7f-41fe-ac48-1a82bafebccf" facs="#m-f741b3c0-8cbd-4028-8bcc-fdb9da9cf808" label="lyrics-like">Nnu-lo sú-o subarrhávit</l><l xml:id="m-1013e882-6eff-461b-9a9a-602774fb6c0b" facs="#m-f25de1c4-7f81-4b4a-9290-cca5ae5f9dc3" label="lyrics-like">me“Dóminus mé-us Jésus Chrístus, et tamquam spón¬</l><l xml:id="m-14111a61-1698-407a-ba84-9faee4ff481c" facs="#m-6939ba53-3ecf-48a8-914a-cca3f01285e3" label="ambiguous">4.Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-faac96b4-a105-4c81-8111-74b286440dd8" facs="#m-27bf5404-03bd-4fb2-81b9-e85854761941" label="ambiguous">8.d</l><l xml:id="m-4dcca185-051c-4f98-a28c-9cd9e0d30964" facs="#m-ea679817-4c1c-4b97-9c84-66bfb741f75d" label="ambiguous">EE</l><l xml:id="m-34917f1e-34b6-4a39-9698-58a19852a2ad" facs="#m-970a1a0d-f3ee-48ab-8313-6caa2bbd5ef1" label="ambiguous">B</l><l xml:id="m-e5e37605-d3da-42bb-96db-3d617f5ff627" facs="#m-c25942cc-f8bd-4e61-915a-97f54e736648" label="ambiguous">Ene¬</l><l xml:id="m-a2b43304-3d07-410a-a66c-28d76c08e219" facs="#m-48be8287-bd67-4aa2-9c6f-ef7bcba2d158" label="lyrics-like">sam decorávit me coró-na.</l><l xml:id="m-0587ab4d-8e66-40a1-9352-bb63c10b67df" facs="#m-73665dfd-77bf-474c-a04f-eaf88565e590" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
